{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"微分分次范畴"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"微分分次范畴"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>交换环 $k$ 上的微分分次范畴 (differential graded category, “dg category”) 是 “$k$-线性"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":"” 的一种模型, 也等同于充实于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Eilenberg–MacLane谱","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane 谱"}},{"Plain":" $Hk$ 上的模范畴 $\\mathsf{Mod}(Hk)$ 的范畴, 或 $\\mathsf{Mod}(Hk)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶模","text":"模"}},{"Plain":";\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{DGCat} = \\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathsf{Mod}(Hk)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>微分分次范畴构成"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"对称幺半 $2$-范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{DGCat}$, 其中的乘法称为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Lurie张量积","text":"Lurie 张量积"}},{"Plain":". "},{"Local":{"url":"紧生成范畴","text":"紧生成"}},{"Plain":"的微分分次范畴是 $\\mathsf{DGCat}$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"可对偶对象","text":"可对偶对象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>单对象的微分分次范畴等同于"},{"Local":{"url":"微分分次代数","text":"微分分次代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为充实 $1$-范畴</h3>\n<p>定义交换环 $k$ 上的微分分次范畴为 $k$-"},{"Local":{"url":"链复形","text":"链复形"}},{"Plain":"的 $1$-范畴 $\\mathsf{Ch}(k)$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}